
# MedSync Health, Inc.
# 2026 Compensation & Bonus Plan

## Philosophy

Our compensation philosophy is to attract, retain, and motivate top talent by providing a competitive and equitable compensation package. We believe in rewarding performance and aligning employee incentives with company success.

## Base Salary

Base salaries are determined based on market data for similar roles, experience, and location. Salaries are reviewed annually, with adjustments based on performance and market trends.

## Annual Performance Bonus

All full-time employees are eligible for an annual performance bonus, targeted as a percentage of their base salary. The bonus is based on a combination of individual and company performance.

| Level | Target Bonus (% of Base Salary) |
|---|---|
| Associate / Analyst | 10% |
| Senior / Lead | 15% |
| Manager / Principal | 20% |
| Director | 25% |
| VP and Above | 30%+ |

## Equity

We believe that all employees should have a stake in the company's success. All full-time employees are granted stock options upon hiring, with additional grants based on performance and promotions.

## 401(k) Plan

MedSync Health offers a 401(k) plan with a company match. We match 50% of employee contributions up to 6% of their salary.
